  Each battery env is a repository as a SWE-Gym, SWE-bench or R2E-Gym image builder leaves it.
  environment/Dockerfile (8 repositories, environment/pool_src/mirrors.txt) and tests/Dockerfile
  (17 repositories, tests/mirrors.txt) clone them from GitHub at build time and pin them to the
  recorded ref maps (*/mirror_refs/). This directory itself holds, per env, excerpts of them:
  head_vs_base.patch, staged.patch, unstaged.patch, the build residue in untracked.tgz, and the
